      "text": "Mention @markoto in a comment"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Comments in markoto are threaded, leave one on a specific passage and your collaborators see it the moment you post. markoto is just another collaborator: type @markoto inside any comment and it joins the thread, reads the anchored text, and replies.",
